13. Law and versions. This licence is governed by the law of England and Wales, subject to mandatory protections in Your jurisdiction. Courts of England and Wales have jurisdiction where legally permitted. Quox may offer NEW versions under revised terms. Publishing new terms does not retroactively withdraw grants validly received for earlier versions. Separately signed agreements and applicable third-party licences govern where they apply.

